   VBUS20 bulk EEHZK1V331P (MAKER, v2/vendor/power/lcsc-panasonic-eehzk1v101xp.pdf p.2): 2.8 A rms at 100 kHz, 125 C; the correction factor is 1.00 from 100 to 500 kHz
   J_VR spring pins: 'Mill-Max 0858 class' (NETLIST). The cited page (v2/vendor/connectors/millmax-rugged-power-spring-pins-page28.pdf) rates the 0850, 0851, 0852 and 0853 at 9 A
