     the REGISTER SETTING at 9 V is 5.05 A (the 50 mA step at or under 5.20 / 1.025 = 5.077 A), whose maximum 5.18 A puts the
     peak at 15.68 A, 89.6 % of the typical Isat; it rests on Isat at 25 C and is recomputed once L1's temperature derating
     is held (C-5)
   VBUS20's bank: the worst can reaches 2.8 A at a front end current of 7.57 A matched and 6.54 A at a 2:1 ESR spread; at the
     proposed maximum 9.370 A the bank's worst can must fall by 1.24 to 1.43 times (matched to 2:1) to meet 2.8 A
   the FETs: the RthetaJA each case needs for TJ 150 C in 62.1 C air is printed in section 4 beside each FET
